  "description": "Superbly presented ground floor 2 bedroom apartment located in this very popular development convenient to all local amenities.\n\nThe location of Knockmaree is excellent. Highly regarded and a much sought after Knockmaree is located on the banks of the river Liffey adjacent Chapelizod Village. A host of local amenities are on its doorstep including transport links, shopping facilities. Knockmaree is 6km from St Stephens Green, a short distance to the N4/M4/M50 as well as Heuston Station. Residents will also benefit from the wonderful Phoenix Park and the Liffey cycling & walking path leading to the famous War Memorial Gardens.",
